r; 5 none), the 3D grass (density multiplier, metres from the camera) and the map's decals, water, local fog and particles leaves and grass brought to measured colours (0 the textures' own, 1 a real leaf's: some 4 to 12 % of the light back, an olive green, not a painted one; NFX_LitData) --- added in config version 62: the debug page (Tools/DebugPage.cs) --- sky: HDRP volumetric clouds following the weather (and the map's cloud sea), the strength of their shadows, the blue haze over distant mountains (0 off) the sky drawn by NatureFX's own engine (physically based atmosphere) over HDRP's the fog and haze drawn by the own engine (lit by the traced sun and the engine's sky) instead of HDRP's all of the opaque lighting from the own engine (roadmap step A): its shadows, lamp shadows, sky light and GI, reflections, whatever the ray tracing toggles say (Rendering.EngineLighting) how bright the own engine's stars are against their physical brightness (the eye's night vision, which the camera's exposure does not reach), and how long a change of weather takes (s) falling rain (with splashes) and snow around the camera: how dense (0 off) shader rebuild: hex tiled textures where the map's [materials] ask for it (antitiling=), 0 off .. 1 cars: NatureFX's lit volumetric tyre smoke and spray (amount, 0 off), whether it replaces the game's own smoke on DX11 (on DX12 the game has none), glowing brake discs and afterfire""},""CarDirt"":{""label"":""Dirt, dust and snow on the car"",""help"":""Builds up as you drive: mud on wet roads, dust on dusty ones, snow on top while it snows. Rain washes it off.""},""CarDirtAmount"":{""label"":""Most dirt"",""help"":""map extension (docs/map-authoring.md 5 and 7): season of the foliage colours and the floating particles (0 automatic: the weather preset, else the map's [defaults] season; 1 spring .. 4 winter; 5 none), the 3D grass (density multiplier, metres from the camera) and the map's decals, water, local fog and particles leaves and grass brought to measured colours (0 the textures' own, 1 a real leaf's: some 4 to 12 % of the light back, an olive green, not a painted one; NFX_LitData) --- added in config version 62: the debug page (Tools/DebugPage.cs) --- sky: HDRP volumetric clouds following the weather (and the map's cloud sea), the strength of their shadows, the blue haze over distant mountains (0 off) the sky drawn by NatureFX's own engine (physically based atmosphere) over HDRP's the fog and haze drawn by the own engine (lit by the traced sun and the engine's sky) instead of HDRP's all of the opaque lighting from the own engine (roadmap step A): its shadows, lamp shadows, sky light and GI, reflections, whatever the ray tracing toggles say (Rendering.EngineLighting) how bright the own engine's stars are against their physical brightness (the eye's night vision, which the camera's exposure does not reach), and how long a change of weather takes (s) falling rain (with splashes) and snow around the camera: how dense (0 off) shader rebuild: hex tiled textures where the map's [materials] ask for it (antitiling=), 0 off .. 1 cars: NatureFX's lit volumetric tyre smoke and spray (amount, 0 off), whether it replaces the game's own smoke on DX11 (on DX12 the game has none), glowing brake discs and afterfire dirt, dust and snow building up on the car nearest the camera (how much at most)""},""RTReflections"":{""label"":""Enable"",""help"":""ray traced reflections (DX12, DXR)""},""RTReflectionIntensity"":{""label"":""Strength"",""help"":""ray traced reflections (DX12, DXR)""},""RTReflectionRoughness"":{""label"":""Rough surfaces up to"",""help"":""surfaces rougher than this get none""},""RTReflectionDistance"":{""label"":""Ray length"",""help"":""ray traced reflections (DX12, DXR)""},""RTReflectionQuality"":{""label"":""Ray traced reflections"",""help"":""0 performance, 1 balanced, 2 quality""},""RTGlassReflections"":{""label"":""Glass reflections"",""help"":""Car windows, lamp lenses and building windows mirror the scene.""},""RTGlassRefraction"":{""label"":""Glass refraction"",""help"":""How much curved glass (lenses, screens) bends what is seen through it. 0: off.""},""RTWetReflections"":{""label"":""Wet road streaks"",""help"":""When the road is wet (Weather: wetness or rain), reflections of lamps and cars stretch along the view as on real wet asphalt.""},""NativeGlass"":{""label"":""Own glass"",""help"":""roadmap E: the own engine draws the glass whole (HDRP's hidden)""},""NativePost"":{""label"":""Own post-processing"",""help"":""roadmap D: NatureFX's own exposure, bloom, tone curve and colour""},""PostBloom"":{""label"":""Bloom"",""help"":""The share of all light a lens and the eye scatter around: bright lamps glow, a grey wall hardly at all (no threshold).""},""ExposureMode"":{""label"":""Exposure"",""help"":""0 fixed (FixedExposure), 1 eye adaptation""},""FixedExposure"":{""label"":""Fixed exposure"",""help"":""Real-world EV: a sunny day about 15, overcast 12, a lit street at night about 3.""},""AutoExposureMin"":{""label"":""Darkest scene"",""help"":""EV100""},""AutoExposureMax"":{""label"":""Brightest scene"",""help"":""Real-world EV: a sunny day is about 15, a lit street at night about 3, a moonlit night about -2. Darkest scene is how far the eye opens up at night: lower lets a moonlit night show.""},""AdaptationSpeed"":{""label"":""Adaptation speed"",""help"":""--- added in config version 5: camera realism ---""},""NightDarkness"":{""label"":""Night seen dark"",""help"":""The eye does not lift a dark scene to grey: about 2 stops darker under street lamps, 3.5 in a dark night. 0: every scene as bright as day.""},""Exposure"":{""label"":""Exposure compensation"",""help"":""exposure and tone (ray tracing only mode, VolumeOverhaul)""},""AcesTonemapping"":{""label"":""Override tonemapping"",""help"":""exposure and tone (ray tracing only mode, VolumeOverhaul)""},""TonemapMode"":{""label"":""Tone"",""help"":""0 ACES, 1 Neutral (Khronos PBR Neutral), 2 AgX, 3 None""},""Contrast"":{""label"":""Contrast"",""help"":""exposure and tone (ray tracing only mode, VolumeOverhaul)""},""Saturation"":{""label"":""Saturation"",""help"":""Like a camera: AgX, contrast 8, saturation 0 (highlights turn white, bright colours do not clip). Neutral keeps the surfaces' colours saturated up to white.""},""WhiteBalance"":{""label"":""White balance (eye)"",""help"":""How much the eye takes the light around as white: a sunset or warm lamps less orange, a shade under a blue sky less blue. 0: the camera's daylight white. Less in the dark, as the eye. Needs Own post-processing.""},""Dlaa"":{""label"":""NVIDIA DLSS"",""help"":""NVIDIA DLSS (own engine) in place of HDRP's TAA, with the own post""},""DlssQuality"":{""label"":""NVIDIA DLSS"",""help"":""0 DLAA, 1 Quality, 2 Balanced, 3 Performance, 4 Ultra performance (upscaling)""},""DlssRayReconstruction"":{""label"":""Ray Reconstruction"",""help"":""DLSS denoises the ray traced sun shadows with the whole picture, in place of NRD and NatureFX's filter (reflections, ambient light, GI and lamp shadows keep theirs). Needs the exact sun light (Shadows). DLAA: anti-aliasing at the display resolution. Quality, Balanced, Performance, Ultra perf.: rendered at 67, 58, 50, 33 % of it and upscaled (faster; the sun shadows get 2 to 4 rays a pixel to keep their quality). At 1080p Quality or Balanced; Ultra perf. is for 4K and above.""},""NightVision"":{""label"":""Night vision"",""help"":""map extension (docs/map-authoring.md 5 and 7): season of the foliage colours and the floating particles (0 automatic: the weather preset, else the map's [defaults] season; 1 spring .. 4 winter; 5 none), the 3D grass (density multiplier, metres from the camera) and the map's decals, water, local fog and particles leaves and grass brought to measured colours (0 the textures' own, 1 a real leaf's: some 4 to 12 % of the light back, an olive green, not a painted one; NFX_LitData) --- added in config version 62: the debug page (Tools/DebugPage.cs) --- sky: HDRP volumetric clouds following the weather (and the map's cloud sea), the strength of their shadows, the blue haze over distant mountains (0 off) the sky drawn by NatureFX's own engine (physically based atmosphere) over HDRP's the fog and haze drawn by the own engine (lit by the traced sun and the engine's sky) instead of HDRP's all of the opaque lighting from the own engine (roadmap step A): its shadows, lamp shadows, sky light and GI, reflections, whatever the ray tracing toggles say (Rendering.EngineLighting) how bright the own engine's stars are against their physical brightness (the eye's night vision, which the camera's exposure does not reach), and how long a change of weather takes (s) falling rain (with splashes) and snow around the camera: how dense (0 off) shader rebuild: hex tiled textures where the map's [materials] ask for it (antitiling=), 0 off .. 1 cars: NatureFX's lit volumetric tyre smoke and spray (amount, 0 off), whether it replaces the game's own smoke on DX11 (on DX12 the game has none), glowing brake discs and afterfire dirt, dust and snow building up on the car nearest the camera (how much at most) the camera and the eye: night vision (Purkinje shift and grain, 0 off), lens flare (0 off), depth of field on the car nearest the camera""},""LensFlare"":{""label"":""Lens flare"",""help"":""map extension (docs/map-authoring.md 5 and 7): season of the foliage colours and the floating particles (0 automatic: the weather preset, else the map's [defaults] season; 1 spring .. 4 winter; 5 none), the 3D grass (density multiplier, metres from the camera) and the map's decals, water, local fog and particles leaves and grass brought to measured colours (0 the textures' own, 1 a real leaf's: some 4 to 12 % of the light back, an olive green, not a painted one; NFX_LitData) --- added in config version 62: the debug page (Tools/DebugPage.cs) --- sky: HDRP volumetric clouds following the weather (and the map's cloud sea), the strength of their shadows, the blue haze over distant mountains (0 off) the sky drawn by NatureFX's own engine (physically based atmosphere) over HDRP's the fog and haze drawn by the own engine (lit by the traced sun and the engine's sky) instead of HDRP's all of the opaque lighting from the own engine (roadmap step A): its shadows, lamp shadows, sky light and GI, reflections, whatever the ray tracing toggles say (Rendering.EngineLighting) how bright the own engine's stars are against their physical brightness (the eye's night vision, which the camera's exposure does not reach), and how long a change of weather takes (s) falling rain (with splashes) and snow around the camera: how dense (0 off) shader rebuild: hex tiled textures where the map's [materials] ask for it (antitiling=), 0 off .. 1 cars: NatureFX's lit volumetric tyre smoke and spray (amount, 0 off), whether it replaces the game's own smoke on DX11 (on DX12 the game has none), glowing brake discs and afterfire dirt, dust and snow building up on the car nearest the camera (how much at most) the camera and the eye: night vision (Purkinje shift and grain, 0 off), lens flare (0 off), depth of field on the car nearest the camera""},""LensStreaks"":{""label"":""Light streaks"",""help"":""map extension (docs/map-authoring.md 5 and 7): season of the foliage colours and the floating particles (0 automatic: the weather preset, else the map's [defaults] season; 1 spring .. 4 winter; 5 none), the 3D grass (density multiplier, metres from the camera) and the map's decals, water, local fog and particles leaves and grass brought to measured colours (0 the textures' own, 1 a real leaf's: some 4 to 12 % of the light back, an olive green, not a painted one; NFX_LitData) --- added in config version 62: the debug page (Tools/DebugPage.cs) --- sky: HDRP volumetric clouds following the weather (and the map's cloud sea), the strength of their shadows, the blue haze over distant mountains (0 off) the sky drawn by NatureFX's own engine (physically based atmosphere) over HDRP's the fog and haze drawn by the own engine (lit by the traced sun and the engine's sky) instead of HDRP's all of the opaque lighting from the own engine (roadmap step A): its shadows, lamp shadows, sky light and GI, reflections, whatever the ray tracing toggles say (Rendering.EngineLighting) how bright the own engine's stars are against their physical brightness (the eye's night vision, which the camera's exposure does not reach), and how long a change of weather takes (s) falling rain (with splashes) and snow around the camera: how dense (0 off) shader rebuild: hex tiled textures where the map's [materials] ask for it (antitiling=), 0 off .. 1 cars: NatureFX's lit volumetric tyre smoke and spray (amount, 0 off), whether it replaces the game's own smoke on DX11 (on DX12 the game has none), glowing brake discs and afterfire dirt, dust and snow building up on the car nearest the camera (how much at most) the camera and the eye: night vision (Purkinje shift and grain, 0 off), lens flare (0 off), depth of field on the car nearest the camera""},""DepthOfField"":{""label"":""Depth of field"",""help"":""map extension (docs/map-authoring.md 5 and 7): season of the foliage colours and the floating particles (0 automatic: the weather preset, else the map's [defaults] season; 1 spring .. 4 winter; 5 none), the 3D grass (density multiplier, metres from the camera) and the map's decals, water, local fog and particles leaves and grass brought to measured colours (0 the textures' own, 1 a real leaf's: some 4 to 12 % of the light back, an olive green, not a painted one; NFX_LitData) --- added in config version 62: the debug page (Tools/DebugPage.cs) --- sky: HDRP volumetric clouds following the weather (and the map's cloud sea), the strength of their shadows, the blue haze over distant mountains (0 off) the sky drawn by NatureFX's own engine (physically based atmosphere) over HDRP's the fog and haze drawn by the own engine (lit by the traced sun and the engine's sky) instead of HDRP's all of the opaque lighting from the own engine (roadmap step A): its shadows, lamp shadows, sky light and GI, reflections, whatever the ray tracing toggles say (Rendering.EngineLighting) how bright the own engine's stars are against their physical brightness (the eye's night vision, which the camera's exposure does not reach), and how long a change of weather takes (s) falling rain (with splashes) and snow around the camera: how dense (0 off) shader rebuild: hex tiled textures where the map's [materials] ask for it (antitiling=), 0 off .. 1 cars: NatureFX's lit volumetric tyre smoke and spray (amount, 0 off), whether it replaces the game's own smoke on DX11 (on DX12 the game has none), glowing brake discs and afterfire dirt, dust and snow building up on the car nearest the camera (how much at most) the camera and the eye: night vision (Purkinje shift and grain, 0 off), lens flare (0 off), depth of field on the car nearest the camera the map's reflection probes (markers and along the road; off: HDRP's own reflections only) draw the map's markers over the picture (F8 > Map), for map authors""},""DofFStop"":{""label"":""Aperture"",""help"":""A real lens focused on the car nearest the camera: a low f-number blurs the background more (f/1.4 to f/2.8 a portrait look, f/8 and up nearly everything sharp).""},""MotionBlur"":{""label"":""Motion blur"",""help"":""How long the shutter stays open, as a share of a frame: 0.5 is a film camera's 180° shutter, 0 off. The chased car stays sharp, the road streams past.""},""RTAO"":{""label"":""Enable"",""help"":""ray traced ambient occlusion (DX12, DXR): darkens the light that does not come from the sun""},""RTGIBounce"":{""label"":""Bounce light"",""help"":""Surfaces pass on their colour and the sun they catch (a red wall tints the road, sunlit tarmac lights the underside of a car). Off: blocking only (ambient occlusion), lighter.""},""RTGIMultiBounce"":{""label"":""Global illumination (every bounce)"",""help"":""Own engine only: light keeps bouncing (floor to wall to ceiling under a roof), lit signs and lamps light their surroundings. Builds up over a few seconds in a world space cache. Off: one bounce.""},""RTGIDistance"":{""label"":""GI distance"",""help"":""own engine: GI ray length (m)""},""RTGIIntensity"":{""label"":""Bounce intensity"",""help"":""own engine: strength of the light GI bounces in""},""SkyLightStrength"":{""label"":""Sky light in the shade"",""help"":""How bright the sky makes what the sun does not reach (with the sky light from the own engine, Sky & fog). 1: as the sky is.""},""SkyLightSaturation"":{""label"":""Sky light colour"",""help"":""How blue the sky's light is in the shade: 1 as the sky model gives it, 0.5 as measured under a clear sky. How strongly the light bounced in (and its colour) is added; 1 is physically right.""},""RTAOStrength"":{""label"":""Strength"",""help"":""ray traced ambient occlusion (DX12, DXR): darkens the light that does not come from the sun""},""RTAODistance"":{""label"":""Distance"",""help"":""How far the light is traced: short for contact shadows in gaps, long for the shade under roofs and trees and bounce from further away.""},""RTSkyOcclusion"":{""label"":""Sky occlusion"",""help"":""Roofs and overhangs further away than the distance still take the sky (the crowd under a stand's roof). 0: off.""},""RTContactShadows"":{""label"":""Contact shadows"",""help"":""Darkens the creases where surfaces meet: barriers on the road, seat rows, wheel arches. Works best with the ray traced shadows on: then only the light that is not sunlight is darkened.""},""AntiTiling"":{""label"":""Anti-tiling"",""help"":""Hex tiles against a texture's visible repeat and seams, on the materials the map's profile asks for (antitiling=). Three texture reads instead of one there.""},""WetGameMaterials"":{""label"":""Wet look on unreplaced HDRP/Lit"",""help"":""Materials left with the game's shaders still get wet in the rain.""},""RTBackend"":{""label"":""Ray tracing engine"",""help"":""how the own engine traces: 0 DXR 1.0 (ray tracing pipelines), 1 DXR 1.1 (inline)""},""RTTraceScale"":{""label"":""Ray tracing engine"",""help"":""ambient / GI / lamp shadows: 0 half resolution, 1 quarter (upscaled over frames)""},""RTDenoiser"":{""label"":""Ray tracing engine"",""help"":""Timings, rays, lamps, the scene and GPU memory: the debug page (Developer > Debug page, in a browser).""},""RTDxr12Sun"":{""label"":""Sun shadows on DXR 1.2 (test)"",""help"":""Stage 1 of the move to DXR 1.2: the sun shadows are traced on a Shader Model 6.9 device next to the game's. Same look; compare the frame rate.""},""UiLargeText"":{""label"":""Larger text"",""help"":""F8 window: background opacity, scale and size (0 = default)""},""DebugPage"":{""label"":""Debug page"",""help"":""a page with memory, timings and the log, for a browser on this PC""},""UseMapProfile"":{""label"":""Use map profiles"",""help"":""map profiles (kino/config/NatureFX/maps/<scene>.nfx)""},""ShowMarkers"":{""label"":""Show markers"",""help"":""Draws every marker over the picture: zones, fog, particle boxes, puddles, decals, probes and lights, with what each is doing. The map has its own profile too; this file overrides it.""},""MapProbes"":{""label"":""Map reflection probes"",""help"":""Reflection probes at the map's markers and along the road (redrawn when the time or the weather changes).""},""GrassDensity"":{""label"":""3D grass density"",""help"":""map extension (docs/map-authoring.md 5 and 7): season of the foliage colours and the floating particles (0 automatic: the weather preset, else the map's [defaults] season; 1 spring .. 4 winter; 5 none), the 3D grass (density multiplier, metres from the camera) and the map's decals, water, local fog and particles leaves and grass brought to measured colours (0 the textures' own, 1 a real leaf's: some 4 to 12 % of the light back, an olive green, not a painted one; NFX_LitData)""},""GrassDistance"":{""label"":""3D grass distance"",""help"":""map extension (docs/map-authoring.md 5 and 7): season of the foliage colours and the floating particles (0 automatic: the weather preset, else the map's [defaults] season; 1 spring .. 4 winter; 5 none), the 3D grass (density multiplier, metres from the camera) and the map's decals, water, local fog and particles leaves and grass brought to measured colours (0 the textures' own, 1 a real leaf's: some 4 to 12 % of the light back, an olive green, not a painted one; NFX_LitData)""},""ShrubDensity"":{""label"":""Thicket density"",""help"":""the map's thickets of scanned shrubs (ShrubRenderer): density, 0 off""},""ShrubDistance"":{""label"":""Scanned shrubs up to"",""help"":""m: where the scans give way to their billboard clouds (impostors at 3x)""},""MapGroundDetail"":{""label"":""Ground detail"",""help"":""the ground map: ground blend, painted dirt and debris on the map""},""Detritus"":{""label"":""Debris (pebbles, twigs, leaves)"",""help"":""debris (pebbles, twigs, leaves) along the road's edges: density, 0 off""},""MapEffects"":{""label"":""Map effects"",""help"":""Local fog: Particles:""},""Enabled"":{""label"":""Enabled"",""help"":""general""},""AccumulateOverTime"":{""label"":""AccumulateOverTime"",""help"":""accumulation / weather""},""AccumulationRate"":{""label"":""AccumulationRate"",""help"":""accumulation / weather""},""Snow"":{""label"":""Snow"",""help"":""accumulation / weather""},""Leaves"":{""label"":""Leaves"",""help"":""accumulation / weather""},""Dust"":{""label"":""Dust"",""help"":""accumulation / weather""},""Wetness"":{""label"":""Wetness"",""help"":""accumulation / weather""},""ReplaceShaders"":{""label"":""ReplaceShaders"",""help"":""shader replacement (needs naturefx.bundle)""},""FullReplacement"":{""label"":""FullReplacement"",""help"":""shader rebuild: every game material becomes a NatureFX one""},""TimeSpeed"":{""label"":""TimeSpeed"",""help"":""how much faster than real time (60: an hour a minute)""},""Rain"":{""label"":""Rain"",""help"":""0..1 ripples, drips, wet surfaces""},""SunSize"":{""label"":""SunSize"",""help"":""angular diameter in degrees (PCSS, needs High shadow filtering)""},""MoonBrightness"":{""label"":""MoonBrightness"",""help"":""the moon's light against its physical strength (1 = real)""},""HeadlightKelvin"":{""label"":""HeadlightKelvin"",""help"":""the lamps' colour temperature (K); 0: the type's own""},""RecordShaderVariants"":{""label"":""RecordShaderVariants"",""help"":""development: log the NatureFX shader variants the game uses, so the bundle build can skip the rest""},""UiOpacity"":{""label"":""UiOpacity"",""help"":""F8 window: background opacity, scale and size (0 = default)""},""UiScale"":{""label"":""UiScale"",""help"":""F8 window: background opacity, scale and size (0 = default)""},""UiWidth"":{""label"":""UiWidth"",""help"":""F8 window: background opacity, scale and size (0 = default)""},""UiHeight"":{""label"":""UiHeight"",""help"":""F8 window: background opacity, scale and size (0 = default)""},""RTShadows"":{""label"":""RTShadows"",""help"":""ray traced sun shadows (DX12, DXR); softness from SunSize""},""RTShadowStrength"":{""label"":""RTShadowStrength"",""help"":""ray traced sun shadows (DX12, DXR); softness from SunSize""},""RTShadowFullRes"":{""label"":""RTShadowFullRes"",""help"":""full resolution (sharp contact shadows) or half""},""RTExactSun"":{""label"":""RTExactSun"",""help"":""take away exactly the sun light HDRP added (G-buffer drawn again)""},""RTLampMasks"":{""label"":""RTLampMasks"",""help"":""roadmap A4: each lamp shadowed by its own mask (with RTExactSun)""},""RTFullRelight"":{""label"":""RTFullRelight"",""help"":""roadmap A4: HDRP's pixel taken apart and lit again by the own engine""},""RTHideFakeShadows"":{""label"":""RTHideFakeShadows"",""help"":""hide the game's painted shadow planes while the ray traced shadows run""},""RebuildFoliage"":{""label"":""RebuildFoliage"",""help"":""shader rebuild: foliage too (wind, snow); off leaves it to the game's shaders""},""RTWind"":{""label"":""RTWind"",""help"":""own engine: the traced foliage sways with the wind as it is drawn""},""RTLeafTranslucency"":{""label"":""RTLeafTranslucency"",""help"":""sunlight through back-lit leaves (0: off)""},""RTShafts"":{""label"":""RTShafts"",""help"":""ray traced light shafts""},""RTShaftDensity"":{""label"":""RTShaftDensity"",""help"":""scattering of the air (1/m)""},""RTShaftAnisotropy"":{""label"":""RTShaftAnisotropy"",""help"":""forward scattering""},""RTLocalLights"":{""label"":""RTLocalLights"",""help"":""headlights and lamps in the ray traced effects""},""RTLampShadows"":{""label"":""RTLampShadows"",""help"":""lamps' HDRP shadow maps off, soft ray traced shadows instead""},""RTEmissiveLights"":{""label"":""RTEmissiveLights"",""help"":""bright emissive surfaces (neon, signs) light their surroundings, with shadows""},""RTGlassShadows"":{""label"":""RTGlassShadows"",""help"":""the sun through glass is dimmed (tinted windows more)""},""RTOverlay"":{""label"":""RTOverlay"",""help"":""on-screen timings, ray counts and memory""},""DebugPagePort"":{""label"":""DebugPagePort"",""help"":""its port on 127.0.0.1""},""TextureStreamingBudget"":{""label"":""TextureStreamingBudget"",""help"":""MB for Unity's texture mip streaming; 0 the game's own""},""WriteMaterialInventory"":{""label"":""WriteMaterialInventory"",""help"":""the shader rebuild's data at each map load (text and texture samples)""},""RTTransparentShadows"":{""label"":""RTTransparentShadows"",""help"":""the sun's ray traced shadow on transparent surfaces (SunShadowMap)""}},""groups"":{""Sky & fog / Sky"":{""name"":""Sky & fog / Sky"",""help"":""The sky computed by NatureFX's own engine from the sun or the moon and the air (physically based), with its clouds, sun and moon discs and stars; HDRP gets it as its sky for reflections and ambient light. Independent of the ray tracing switches.""},""Sky & fog / Clouds and stars"":{""name"":""Sky & fog / Clouds and stars"",""help"":""Volumetric clouds of the weather's cloud types, drifting with its wind, and their shadows on the ground. A map can put a cloud sea into its valleys ([clouds] sea = <height>).""},""Sky & fog / Fog"":{""name"":""Sky & fog / Fog"",""help"":""Fog and haze in 3D from the own engine, lit by the traced sun or moon, the sky and the lamps and headlights; the map's local fog and the tyre smoke are part of it.""},""Sky & fog / HDRP's fog"":{""name"":""Sky & fog / HDRP's fog"",""help"":""Only with Native fog off (HDRP's volumetric fog in its place).""},""Lighting & shadows / Native lighting"":{""name"":""Lighting & shadows / Native lighting"",""help"":""All of the opaque lighting from the own engine: traced sun and moon shadows, lamp and headlight shadows, the sky light and GI, reflections, whatever the ray tracing switches say. Their quality is set below and in Ambient light & GI and Reflections & glass.""},""Lighting & shadows / The game's particles"":{""name"":""Lighting & shadows / The game's particles"",""help"":""The game's and the track's own alpha blended particles (dust, spray, smoke) drawn with NatureFX's particle shader, lit by the own engine's sun or moon, sky and lamps and inside its 3D fog. Fire, sparks and glows keep their own.""},""Lighting & shadows / HDRP's sun shadows"":{""name"":""Lighting & shadows / HDRP's sun shadows"",""help"":""Only with Native lighting off (HDRP's shadow maps in place of the traced shadows).""},""Sun & time / Time of day"":{""name"":""Sun & time / Time of day"",""help"":""""},""Nature / Wind"":{""name"":""Nature / Wind"",""help"":""""},""Weather / Weather"":{""name"":""Weather / Weather"",""help"":""""},""Weather / Season"":{""name"":""Weather / Season"",""help"":""Colours of the trees and grass that the map's profile describes, and the floating particles. Auto: the Autumn and Snow weather, else the map's own season.""},""Weather / Rain and snow"":{""name"":""Weather / Rain and snow"",""help"":""Falling rain and snow around the camera, with the weather: rain streaks that splash where they land and show in headlights and under street lights, drifting snowflakes. 0 turns them off.""},""Road / Road surface"":{""name"":""Road / Road surface"",""help"":""Marks are kept around the camera and cleared when you drive far away.""},""Cars / Headlights"":{""name"":""Cars / Headlights"",""help"":""A real low beam in place of the game's round spot: the lamp's colour and strength, and the beam's sharp cut-off just below the horizon (rising on the kerb side, left: driving on the left), so the road is lit and the eyes above it are not.""},""Cars / Car finish"":{""name"":""Cars / Car finish"",""help"":""Paint reflects like real car paint: a clear varnish mirror over the coloured base. DX12 ray tracing.""},""Cars / Cars in the rain"":{""name"":""Cars / Cars in the rain"",""help"":""Beading drops, water running off and an oily sheen, drawn over the car paint.""},""Cars / Smoke, glow and dirt"":{""name"":""Cars / Smoke, glow and dirt"",""help"":""Volumetric tyre smoke and spray lit by the sun, lamps and headlights (needs Tyre marks on: it starts where the tyres slide). Brake discs that glow after hard braking, afterfire.""},""Reflections & glass / Ray traced reflections"":{""name"":""Reflections & glass / Ray traced reflections"",""help"":""Wet roads, puddles and car paint reflect the whole scene, including what is off screen. DX12 only.""},""Reflections & glass / Glass"":{""name"":""Reflections & glass / Glass"",""help"":""The own engine draws the glass whole: what it lets through (tinted by its colour as far as it is opaque), what it mirrors (traced), the sun's glint and the bend of solid glass. HDRP's glass is hidden meanwhile. Needs Glass reflections.""},""Exposure & tone / Own post-processing"":{""name"":""Exposure & tone / Own post-processing"",""help"":""NatureFX's own exposure (metering and eye adaptation), bloom, tone curve and colour, in place of HDRP's. HDRP's own post-processing, TAA and colour grading are off meanwhile (anti-aliasing: DLSS, else the own TAA).""},""Exposure & tone / Exposure"":{""name"":""Exposure & tone / Exposure"",""help"":""Fixed: one exposure for every scene, like a camera set by hand; eye adaptation brightens shade and tunnels and settles back in sunlight.""},""Exposure & tone / Tone"":{""name"":""Exposure & tone / Tone"",""help"":""""},""DLSS / NVIDIA DLSS"":{""name"":""DLSS / NVIDIA DLSS"",""help"":""Anti-aliasing and upscaling by NatureFX's own engine in place of HDRP's TAA (RTX GPUs; others get the own TAA). Needs Own post-processing (Exposure & tone).""},""Lens & eye / Eye and lens"":{""name"":""Lens & eye / Eye and lens"",""help"":""Night vision: in the dark colours fade towards blue-green and dim parts get grainy, as the eye sees. Lens flare: ghosts and streaks from bright lights. Depth of field: focus on the car, for replays and photos.""},""Ambient light & GI / Ray traced ambient light"":{""name"":""Ambient light & GI / Ray traced ambient light"",""help"":""Light that does not come straight from the sun: darkened where the surroundings block the sky (under cars, roofs and trees, in corners and gaps) and tinted by what it bounces off. The sun light is left to the shadows. DX12 only.""},""Shader rebuild / Shader rebuild"":{""name"":""Shader rebuild / Shader rebuild"",""help"":""NatureFX's own shaders in place of the game's. Replaced materials also enter the ray tracing with their real colour and smoothness.""},""Ray tracing / Ray tracing engine"":{""name"":""Ray tracing / Ray tracing engine"",""help"":""How NatureFX's own engine (NFXNative.dll) traces every ray traced effect (surfaces, shadows, ambient light, lamps, light shafts, reflections). DX12 only.""},""Settings / Interface"":{""name"":""Settings / Interface"",""help"":""""},""Developer / Debug page"":{""name"":""Developer / Debug page"",""help"":""Everything for development is on the debug page now: video memory, GPU and CPU load, the scene and the log, and the developer's switches and tools (ray tracing views, NRD parts, DLSS tests, shader reload, texture budget, shader dumps). Served on this PC only (127.0.0.1): open the address below in a browser (a second screen).""},""Map / Map profile"":{""name"":""Map / Map profile"",""help"":""Per-map settings from the map's nfx_profile object, or kino/config/NatureFX/maps/<scene>.nfx (that file wins). docs/map-authoring.md""},""Map / Lights and reflections"":{""name"":""Map / Lights and reflections"",""help"":""Light markers switch on at dusk or night (Sun > time of day to check).""},""Map / Grass and forest"":{""name"":""Map / Grass and forest"",""help"":""3D grass needs Replace shaders on (Shader rebuild).""},""Map / Ground detail"":{""name"":""Map / Ground detail"",""help"":""Objects take the ground's colour where they stand in it, the profile's painted dirt ([paint]) and debris along the road's edges. Needs the own engine.""},""Map / Effects"":{""name"":""Map / Effects"",""help"":""Decals, puddles and water, local fog and floating particles. Each shows what it is doing or what it waits for.""}}},""ja"":{""settings"":{""NativeSky"":{""label"":""独自エンジンの空"",""help"":""HDRP の空の代わりに、NatureFX の独自エンジンが物理ベースの大気で空を描画。""},""OwnSkyLighting"":{""label"":""空の光と反射を独自エンジンで"",""help"":""HDRP の天空光・空の反射・空をオフにし、独自エンジンの GI と反射で置き換える。周囲の遮蔽が反映される（ガレージ内の塗装に空は映らない）。各要素はそれぞれのレイトレースパスが動作している間のみ。""},""OwnSunLight"":{""label"":""太陽光を独自エンジンで"",""help"":""HDRP の太陽光は何も照らさず、レイトレース影のパスがトレースした影の下に太陽光を加える（HDRP と同様に G-buffer から計算し、G-buffer がない所は独自に計算）。正確な太陽光（ライティングと影）が動作している間のみ。""},""OwnLampLight"":{""label"":""ランプの光を独自エンジンで"",""help"":""HDRP の街灯・ヘッドライトなどのランプは何も照らさず、ランプマスクのパスが光を計算（クッキーも含む）し、影の合成で各ランプのトレース影を通った分を加える。ランプマスク（ライティングと影）が動作している間のみ。""},""OwnBrdf"":{""label"":""独自 BSDF（G-buffer 複製なし、実験的）"",""help"":""実験的機能。色はトレースした表面から取るため、NatureFX のマテリアル処理（アンチタイリング、堆積、地面ブレンド、塗装、ディテールマップ）が入らず、模様が二重に見えることがある。太陽とランプは、HDRP の G-buffer をもう一度描いて HDRP の BSDF で照らす代わりに、トレースした表面と HDRP の法線から独自エンジンの BSDF で照らす。ビデオメモリが減り、シーンパスが 1 回少なくなる。HDRP のマテリアル詳細（サブサーフェス、異方性、塗装のフレーク）は近似。独自エンジンの太陽光・ランプ光とランプマスクが必要。DLSS Ray Reconstruction とは併用不可。""},""OwnTransparentLight"":{""label"":""半透明面の光"",""help"":""レイトレース合成の後に HDRP が描く半透明のもの（フェンス、看板、光を受けるパーティクル）は、HDRP の太陽とランプを保ち、独自エンジンの天空光を受ける。HDRP のライトはそれらの面だけが属するレンダリングレイヤーに置かれる。オフ：独自エンジンが他を照らす間、これらは光を受けない。""},""Clouds"":{""label"":""ボリュメトリッククラウド"",""help"":""天候（とマップの雲海）に合わせた HDRP のボリュメトリッククラウドを表示。""},""CloudShadows"":{""label"":""雲の影"",""help"":""雲が地面に落とす影の濃さ。""},""StarBrightness"":{""label"":""星の明るさ"",""help"":""物理的な明るさに対する星の明るさ。目の夜間視はカメラの露出よりずっと多くの星を見る。""},""NativeFog"":{""label"":""独自エンジンの霧"",""help"":""HDRP の霧の代わりに、独自エンジンが霧ともやを描画（トレースした太陽と独自エンジンの空で照らす）。""},""AerialHaze"":{""label"":""遠景のもや"",""help"":""遠くの山にかかる青いもやの強さ（0 でオフ）。""},""HeadlightShafts"":{""label"":""ヘッドライトの光芒"",""help"":""澄んだ空気中でヘッドライトやランプの光芒がどれだけ見えるか（0：見えない、1：実際の澄んだ空気程度）。天候の霧やマップの霧の中では常に完全に見える。""},""LightShafts"":{""label"":""霧の中の太陽"",""help"":""太陽（と月）が HDRP のボリュメトリックフォグを照らす強さ。木々や建物の間の光芒。マップにボリュメトリックフォグが必要。""},""NativeLighting"":{""label"":""独自エンジンのライティング"",""help"":""不透明物のライティングをすべて独自エンジンで行う。影、ランプの影、天空光と GI、反射を、レイトレーシングの各スイッチの設定にかかわらず使用。""},""NativeParticles"":{""label"":""パーティクルを独自ライティングで"",""help"":""ゲーム本来のパーティクルを NatureFX のパーティクルシェーダーで描画。""},""RealisticShadows"":{""label"":""HDRP の太陽の影をソフトに"",""help"":""HDRP 自身の太陽の影を、影を落とす物体からの距離に応じて、太陽のサイズに従ってぼかす。雲の下ではよりソフトに（シャドウフィルタリング「高」）。レイトレース影は独自のソフトさを持つ。独自エンジンのライティング（ライティングと影）がオンの間は、下のスイッチにかかわらず動作。""},""SunOverride"":{""label"":""太陽を上書き"",""help"":""有効の間、コースのディレクショナルライトを NatureFX の太陽と時刻で上書き。""},""SyncGameNight"":{""label"":""ゲームの夜間照明"",""help"":""コース本来の夜間照明（街灯、窓の明かり）を、ゲームのナイトレースと同様に NatureFX の時刻の夕暮れに点灯、夜明けに消灯。""},""TimeOfDay"":{""label"":""時刻"",""help"":""時刻（0〜24 時）。""},""TimePasses"":{""label"":""時間を進める"",""help"":""下の速度で時刻が自動で進む（上のスライダーも連動）。""},""SunAzimuthOffset"":{""label"":""方位オフセット"",""help"":""コースの太陽の方位に加える角度（度）。""},""SunMaxElevation"":{""label"":""最大高度"",""help"":""正午の太陽高度（度）。""},""SunIntensityScale"":{""label"":""強さ"",""help"":""太陽光の強さの倍率。""},""SunTemperature"":{""label"":""色温度"",""help"":""正午の色温度（K）。地平線に近いほど暖色になる。""},""Moonlight"":{""label"":""夜の月明かり"",""help"":""夜に月が地面を照らす。""},""Wind"":{""label"":""有効"",""help"":""風で草木を揺らす。""},""WindStrength"":{""label"":""強さ"",""help"":""風の強さ。""},""WindGust"":{""label"":""突風"",""help"":""突風の強さ。""},""WindDirection"":{""label"":""向き"",""help"":""風の向き。""},""LeafFlutter"":{""label"":""葉のなびき"",""help"":""葉が細かく揺れる量。""},""FoliageSway"":{""label"":""草木の揺れ"",""help"":""枝や草全体が風で揺れる量。""},""InteractiveFoliage"":{""label"":""車が草を押し倒す"",""help"":""車が通ると草が押し倒される。""},""Accumulation"":{""label"":""有効"",""help"":""雪・落ち葉・ほこり・濡れの堆積を表示。""},""WeatherPreset"":{""label"":""天候"",""help"":""天候のプリセット。""},""WeatherCycle"":{""label"":""天候の変化"",""help"":""晴れ、曇り、雨、霧…と天候が自動で移り変わる。""},""WeatherCycleMinutes"":{""label"":""変化の間隔"",""help"":""天候が変わる間隔（分）。""},""CloudAmount"":{""label"":""雲量"",""help"":""晴れと手動の天候での雲。0：少しの晴天積雲がある晴れ空、0.5：半分ほど覆う、1：曇天。手動で雨にすると、必要な分だけ空が閉じる。""},""WeatherChangeTime"":{""label"":""変化にかかる時間"",""help"":""天候の変化にかかる時間（雲も含む）。""},""Season"":{""label"":""季節"",""help"":""草木の色と浮遊パーティクルの季節（0 自動：天候プリセット、なければマップの [defaults] の季節。1 春〜4 冬。5 なし）。""},""FoliageColor"":{""label"":""実際の葉の色"",""help"":""1：葉や草を本物と同じく暗いオリーブ色に（葉が返す光は 4〜12 % 程度）。0：テクスチャ本来の色。""},""Precipitation"":{""label"":""降水"",""help"":""カメラ周辺に降る雨（はね付き）と雪の密度（0 でオフ）。""},""SnowDepth"":{""label"":""積雪の深さ"",""help"":""雪が最大のときの実際の積雪の厚さ（m）。""},""TireMarks"":{""label"":""タイヤ痕、乾いたライン、雪のわだち"",""help"":""タイヤ痕、濡れた路面に残る乾いた走行ライン、雪のわだちを描く。""},""RubberAmount"":{""label"":""スライド時のゴム"",""help"":""滑ったときに路面に残るゴムの量。""},""SurfaceDetail"":{""label"":""路面のディテール"",""help"":""路面の細かな凹凸と質感の強さ。""},""RoadWear"":{""label"":""路面の摩耗"",""help"":""走行した路面に長い筋状にゴムが残り、所々が磨かれて滑らかになる（シェーダー再構築の「ゲームのシェーダーを置き換え」が必要）。""},""HeadlightType"":{""label"":""ヘッドライト"",""help"":""ハロゲン：暖色 3200 K、1 灯 18 000 cd。HID（キセノン）：4300 K、36 000 cd、カットオフにわずかな青い縁。LED：5800 K、30 000 cd。""},""HeadlightStandard"":{""label"":""配光の規格"",""help"":""ロービームの向き。0 日本（左側通行）、1 欧州 / 米国（右側通行）。""},""HeadlightAim"":{""label"":""光軸の向き"",""help"":""ロービームの光軸を水平から下げる角度（°）。""},""CarChromeRims"":{""label"":""クロームホイール"",""help"":""金属ホイール（クローム塗装も含む）をヘアライン仕上げのアルミではなく鏡面に。塗装ホイールはそのまま。""},""CarRain"":{""label"":""有効"",""help"":""雨の日に車体に水滴と油膜を描く。""},""CarRainDrops"":{""label"":""水滴"",""help"":""車体に付く水滴の量。""},""OilFilm"":{""label"":""油膜"",""help"":""濡れた車体の油膜の光沢の強さ。""},""TireSmoke"":{""label"":""タイヤスモークと水しぶき"",""help"":""NatureFX のライティングされたボリュメトリックなタイヤスモークと水しぶきの量（0 でオフ）。""},""ReplaceGameSmoke"":{""label"":""ゲームのスモークを置き換え（DX11）"",""help"":""DX12 ではゲームにタイヤスモークがないため、常にこちらを使用。""},""CarGlow"":{""label"":""ブレーキの赤熱、アフターファイア"",""help"":""強いブレーキ後に赤熱するブレーキディスクとアフターファイアを表示。""},""CarDirt"":{""label"":""車の汚れ、ほこり、雪"",""help"":""走るうちに堆積する。濡れた道では泥、ほこりっぽい道ではほこり、雪の間は上面に雪。雨で洗い流される。""},""CarDirtAmount"":{""label"":""汚れの上限"",""help"":""カメラに最も近い車に堆積する汚れ・ほこり・雪の最大量。""},""RTReflections"":{""label"":""有効"",""help"":""レイトレース反射（DX12、DXR）を使用。""},""RTReflectionIntensity"":{""label"":""強さ"",""help"":""レイトレース反射の強さ。""},""RTReflectionRoughness"":{""label"":""反射する粗さの上限"",""help"":""これより粗い面には反射が付かない。""},""RTReflectionDistance"":{""label"":""レイの長さ"",""help"":""反射のレイを飛ばす距離。""},""RTReflectionQuality"":{""label"":""レイトレース反射の品質"",""help"":""0 パフォーマンス、1 バランス、2 品質。""},""RTGlassReflections"":{""label"":""ガラスの反射"",""help"":""車の窓、ランプのレンズ、建物の窓にシーンが映る。""},""RTGlassRefraction"":{""label"":""ガラスの屈折"",""help"":""曲面ガラス（レンズ、スクリーン）越しの像が曲がる量。0：オフ。""},""RTWetReflections"":{""label"":""濡れた路面の筋"",""help"":""路面が濡れていると（天候：濡れまたは雨）、ランプや車の反射が実際の濡れたアスファルトのように縦に伸びる。""},""NativeGlass"":{""label"":""独自エンジンのガラス"",""help"":""ガラスをすべて独自エンジンで描画（HDRP のガラスは非表示）。""},""NativePost"":{""label"":""独自ポストプロセス"",""help"":""NatureFX 独自の露出、ブルーム、トーンカーブ、色を使用。""},""PostBloom"":{""label"":""ブルーム"",""help"":""レンズと目が周囲に散らす光の割合。明るいランプは光り、灰色の壁はほとんど光らない（しきい値なし）。""},""ExposureMode"":{""label"":""露出"",""help"":""0 固定（固定露出）、1 目の順応。""},""FixedExposure"":{""label"":""固定露出"",""help"":""実際の EV 値。晴天で約 15、曇天 12、夜の明るい街路で約 3。""},""AutoExposureMin"":{""label"":""最も暗いシーン"",""help"":""自動露出の下限（EV100）。""},""AutoExposureMax"":{""label"":""最も明るいシーン"",""help"":""実際の EV 値。晴天で約 15、夜の明るい街路で約 3、月夜で約 -2。「最も暗いシーン」は夜に目がどこまで開くか。低くすると月夜が見えるようになる。""},""AdaptationSpeed"":{""label"":""順応の速さ"",""help"":""明るさの変化に目が順応する速さ。""},""NightDarkness"":{""label"":""夜を暗く見せる"",""help"":""目は暗いシーンを灰色まで持ち上げない。街灯の下で約 2 段、暗い夜で 3.5 段暗く。0：どのシーンも昼と同じ明るさ。""},""Exposure"":{""label"":""露出補正"",""help"":""画面全体の露出を補正。""},""AcesTonemapping"":{""label"":""トーンカーブを上書き"",""help"":""ゲームのトーンカーブを下で選んだものに置き換える。""},""TonemapMode"":{""label"":""トーン"",""help"":""0 ACES、1 Neutral（Khronos PBR Neutral）、2 AgX、3 なし。""},""Contrast"":{""label"":""コントラスト"",""help"":""トーンカーブのコントラスト。""},""Saturation"":{""label"":""彩度"",""help"":""カメラに近いのは AgX、コントラスト 8、彩度 0（ハイライトは白くなり、鮮やかな色が飽和しない）。Neutral は面の色を白に近づくまで鮮やかに保つ。""},""WhiteBalance"":{""label"":""ホワイトバランス（目）"",""help"":""目が周囲の光をどれだけ白として受け取るか。夕日や暖色のランプはオレンジが弱まり、青空の下の日陰は青みが弱まる。0：カメラの昼光の白。目と同様に暗いほど弱まる。独自ポストプロセスが必要。""},""Dlaa"":{""label"":""NVIDIA DLSS"",""help"":""HDRP の TAA の代わりに NVIDIA DLSS（独自エンジン）を独自ポストプロセスと共に使用。""},""DlssQuality"":{""label"":""DLSS モード"",""help"":""0 DLAA、1 品質、2 バランス、3 パフォーマンス、4 ウルトラパフォーマンス（アップスケーリング）。""},""DlssRayReconstruction"":{""label"":""Ray Reconstruction"",""help"":""NRD と NatureFX のフィルターの代わりに、DLSS が画面全体を使ってレイトレースの太陽の影をデノイズ（反射、環境光、GI、ランプの影は従来どおり）。正確な太陽光（影）が必要。DLAA：表示解像度でのアンチエイリアス。品質、バランス、パフォーマンス、ウルトラパフォーマンス：その 67、58、50、33 % で描画してアップスケール（高速。太陽の影は品質維持のため 1 ピクセル 2〜4 レイ）。1080p では品質かバランス。ウルトラパフォーマンスは 4K 以上向け。""},""NightVision"":{""label"":""夜間視"",""help"":""目の夜間視（プルキンエ現象と粒状感）の強さ（0 でオフ）。""},""LensFlare"":{""label"":""レンズフレア"",""help"":""明るい光源からのレンズフレアの強さ（0 でオフ）。""},""LensStreaks"":{""label"":""光条"",""help"":""明るい光源から伸びる光の筋の強さ。""},""DepthOfField"":{""label"":""被写界深度"",""help"":""カメラに最も近い車にピントを合わせた被写界深度。""},""DofFStop"":{""label"":""絞り"",""help"":""カメラに最も近い車にピントを合わせた実際のレンズ。F 値が低いほど背景がぼける（f/1.4〜f/2.8 でポートレート風、f/8 以上でほぼ全体がシャープ）。""},""MotionBlur"":{""label"":""モーションブラー"",""help"":""シャッターが開いている時間（1 フレームに対する割合）。0.5 で映画用カメラの 180° シャッター、0 でオフ。追っている車はシャープなまま、路面が流れる。""},""RTAO"":{""label"":""有効"",""help"":""レイトレース環境光遮蔽（DX12、DXR）。太陽以外からの光を暗くする。""},""RTGIBounce"":{""label"":""バウンス光"",""help"":""面が自身の色と受けた日光を周囲に渡す（赤い壁が路面を染め、日の当たる舗装が車の下面を照らす）。オフ：遮蔽のみ（環境光遮蔽）で軽い。""},""RTGIMultiBounce"":{""label"":""グローバルイルミネーション（多重バウンス）"",""help"":""独自エンジンのみ。光が跳ね返り続け（屋根の下で床から壁、天井へ）、光る看板やランプが周囲を照らす。ワールド空間のキャッシュに数秒かけて蓄積。オフ：1 回のバウンス。""},""RTGIDistance"":{""label"":""GI の距離"",""help"":""独自エンジンの GI のレイの長さ（m）。""},""RTGIIntensity"":{""label"":""バウンスの強さ"",""help"":""独自エンジンの GI が跳ね返す光の強さ。""},""SkyLightStrength"":{""label"":""日陰の天空光"",""help"":""太陽が届かない場所を空がどれだけ明るくするか（独自エンジンの天空光使用時、空と霧）。1：空のとおり。""},""SkyLightSaturation"":{""label"":""天空光の色"",""help"":""日陰での天空光の青さ。1 は空のモデルどおり、0.5 は晴天下の実測値。跳ね返ってきた光の強さ（とその色）も加わる。1 が物理的に正しい値。""},""RTAOStrength"":{""label"":""強さ"",""help"":""レイトレース環境光遮蔽の強さ。""},""RTAODistance"":{""label"":""距離"",""help"":""光をトレースする距離。短いと隙間の接触影、長いと屋根や木の下の陰と遠くからのバウンス光。""},""RTSkyOcclusion"":{""label"":""天空の遮蔽"",""help"":""距離より遠くにある屋根やひさしも空をさえぎる（スタンドの屋根の下の観客など）。0：オフ。""},""RTContactShadows"":{""label"":""接触影"",""help"":""面が接する部分を暗くする（路面上のバリア、座席の列、ホイールハウス）。レイトレース影がオンのときに最も効果的で、日光以外の光だけが暗くなる。""},""AntiTiling"":{""label"":""アンチタイリング"",""help"":""マップのプロファイルが指定したマテリアル（antitiling=）で、六角形タイルによりテクスチャの繰り返しと継ぎ目を目立たなくする。その部分ではテクスチャ読み込みが 1 回から 3 回に。""},""WetGameMaterials"":{""label"":""置き換えない HDRP/Lit の濡れ表現"",""help"":""ゲームのシェーダーのままのマテリアルも雨で濡れる。""},""RTBackend"":{""label"":""レイトレーシングエンジン"",""help"":""独自エンジンのトレース方式。0 DXR 1.0（レイトレーシングパイプライン）、1 DXR 1.1（インライン）。""},""RTTraceScale"":{""label"":""トレース解像度"",""help"":""環境光・GI・ランプの影の解像度。0 半分、1 4 分の 1（フレームをまたいでアップスケール）。""},""RTDenoiser"":{""label"":""デノイザー"",""help"":""0 単純なブラー、1 分散ガイド（信号がきれいな所はシャープに）、2 NVIDIA NRD（SIGMA / REBLUR）。""},""RTDxr12Sun"":{""label"":""DXR 1.2 で太陽の影（テスト）"",""help"":""DXR 1.2 移行の第 1 段階。太陽の影をゲームとは別の Shader Model 6.9 デバイスでトレース。見た目は同じなのでフレームレートを比較。""},""UiLargeText"":{""label"":""文字を大きく"",""help"":""F8 ウィンドウの文字を大きくする。""},""DebugPage"":{""label"":""デバッグページ"",""help"":""メモリ、処理時間、ログを表示するページを、この PC のブラウザ向けに提供。""},""UseMapProfile"":{""label"":""マッププロファイルを使用"",""help"":""マップごとのプロファイル（kino/config/NatureFX/maps/<scene>.nfx）を読み込む。""},""ShowMarkers"":{""label"":""マーカーを表示"",""help"":""すべてのマーカーを画面に重ねて表示：ゾーン、霧、パーティクルボックス、水たまり、デカール、プローブ、ライト、それぞれの動作状況。マップ自体にもプロファイルがあり、このファイルが優先される。""},""MapProbes"":{""label"":""マップの反射プローブ"",""help"":""マップのマーカー位置と道路沿いの反射プローブ（時刻や天候が変わると再描画）。""},""GrassDensity"":{""label"":""3D 草の密度"",""help"":""3D の草の密度の倍率。""},""GrassDistance"":{""label"":""3D 草の距離"",""help"":""3D の草を描くカメラからの距離（m）。""},""ShrubDensity"":{""label"":""茂みの密度"",""help"":""マップのスキャンした低木の茂み（ShrubRenderer）の密度。0 でオフ。""},""ShrubDistance"":{""label"":""スキャン低木の距離"",""help"":""スキャンモデルからビルボードの集まりに切り替わる距離（m）。インポスターはその 3 倍まで。""},""MapGroundDetail"":{""label"":""地面のディテール"",""help"":""グラウンドマップ：地面ブレンド、マップに描いた汚れと散乱物。""},""Detritus"":{""label"":""散乱物（小石、小枝、落ち葉）"",""help"":""道路の端に散らばる小石、小枝、落ち葉の密度。0 でオフ。""},""MapEffects"":{""label"":""マップエフェクト"",""help"":""マップのデカール、水たまりと水面、局所的な霧、浮遊パーティクルを表示。""},""Enabled"":{""label"":""有効"",""help"":""NatureFX 全体のオン / オフ。""},""AccumulateOverTime"":{""label"":""時間で堆積"",""help"":""雪や落ち葉などが時間とともに堆積していく。""},""AccumulationRate"":{""label"":""堆積の速さ"",""help"":""堆積する速さ（/分）。""},""Snow"":{""label"":""雪"",""help"":""雪の堆積量。""},""Leaves"":{""label"":""落ち葉"",""help"":""落ち葉の堆積量。""},""Dust"":{""label"":""ほこり"",""help"":""ほこりの堆積量。""},""Wetness"":{""label"":""濡れ"",""help"":""地面や物の濡れ具合。""},""ReplaceShaders"":{""label"":""ゲームのシェーダーを置き換え"",""help"":""ゲームのシェーダーを NatureFX のものに置き換える（naturefx.bundle が必要）。""},""FullReplacement"":{""label"":""全マテリアルを置き換え"",""help"":""シェーダー再構築：ゲームのすべてのマテリアルを NatureFX のものにする。""},""TimeSpeed"":{""label"":""時間の速さ"",""help"":""実時間の何倍で進むか（60：1 分で 1 時間）。""},""Rain"":{""label"":""雨"",""help"":""雨の量（0〜1）。波紋、しずく、濡れた面。""},""SunSize"":{""label"":""太陽のサイズ"",""help"":""太陽の視直径（度）。影のぼけに使う（PCSS、シャドウフィルタリング「高」が必要）。""},""MoonBrightness"":{""label"":""月の明るさ"",""help"":""物理的な強さに対する月明かりの明るさ（1 = 実際の明るさ）。""},""HeadlightKelvin"":{""label"":""ヘッドライトの色温度"",""help"":""ランプの色温度（K）。0：タイプ本来の値。""},""RecordShaderVariants"":{""label"":""シェーダーバリアントを記録"",""help"":""開発用。ゲームが使う NatureFX のシェーダーバリアントをログに記録し、バンドルのビルドで残りを省けるようにする。""},""UiOpacity"":{""label"":""背景の不透明度"",""help"":""F8 ウィンドウの背景の不透明度（0 = 既定値）。""},""UiScale"":{""label"":""拡大率"",""help"":""F8 ウィンドウの拡大率（0 = 既定値）。""},""UiWidth"":{""label"":""幅"",""help"":""F8 ウィンドウの幅（0 = 既定値）。""},""UiHeight"":{""label"":""高さ"",""help"":""F8 ウィンドウの高さ（0 = 既定値）。""},""RTShadows"":{""label"":""レイトレース影"",""help"":""レイトレースの太陽の影（DX12、DXR）。ソフトさは太陽のサイズで決まる。""},""RTShadowStrength"":{""label"":""影の濃さ"",""help"":""レイトレースの太陽の影の濃さ。""},""RTShadowFullRes"":{""label"":""影をフル解像度で"",""help"":""フル解像度（くっきりした接触影）か半分の解像度か。""},""RTExactSun"":{""label"":""正確な太陽光"",""help"":""HDRP が加えた太陽光をちょうど取り除く（G-buffer を再描画）。""},""RTLampMasks"":{""label"":""ランプマスク"",""help"":""各ランプを個別のマスクで影付けする（正確な太陽光と併用）。""},""RTFullRelight"":{""label"":""完全な再ライティング"",""help"":""HDRP のピクセルを分解し、独自エンジンで照らし直す。""},""RTHideFakeShadows"":{""label"":""偽の影を隠す"",""help"":""レイトレース影の動作中、ゲームの描き込まれた影の板を非表示にする。""},""RebuildFoliage"":{""label"":""草木も再構築"",""help"":""シェーダー再構築を草木にも適用（風、雪）。オフでゲームのシェーダーのまま。""},""RTWind"":{""label"":""トレースする草木を風で揺らす"",""help"":""独自エンジン：トレースする草木も描画と同じく風で揺れる。""},""RTLeafTranslucency"":{""label"":""葉の透過光"",""help"":""逆光の葉を透ける日光（0：オフ）。""},""RTShafts"":{""label"":""光芒"",""help"":""レイトレースの光芒を描く。""},""RTShaftDensity"":{""label"":""光芒の密度"",""help"":""空気の散乱係数（1/m）。""},""RTShaftAnisotropy"":{""label"":""光芒の異方性"",""help"":""前方散乱の強さ。""},""RTLocalLights"":{""label"":""ローカルライト"",""help"":""ヘッドライトやランプをレイトレース効果に含める。""},""RTLampShadows"":{""label"":""ランプの影"",""help"":""ランプの HDRP シャドウマップをオフにし、代わりにソフトなレイトレース影を使う。""},""RTEmissiveLights"":{""label"":""発光面のライト"",""help"":""明るい発光面（ネオン、看板）が影付きで周囲を照らす。""},""RTGlassShadows"":{""label"":""ガラスの影"",""help"":""ガラスを通る日光を減衰（スモークガラスはより強く）。""},""RTOverlay"":{""label"":""オーバーレイ"",""help"":""処理時間、レイ数、メモリを画面に表示。""},""DebugPagePort"":{""label"":""デバッグページのポート"",""help"":""127.0.0.1 上のポート番号。""},""TextureStreamingBudget"":{""label"":""テクスチャストリーミング予算"",""help"":""Unity のテクスチャミップストリーミングに割り当てる MB。0 でゲームの設定のまま。""},""WriteMaterialInventory"":{""label"":""マテリアル一覧を書き出す"",""help"":""マップ読み込みごとにシェーダー再構築用のデータ（テキストとテクスチャサンプル）を書き出す。""},""RTTransparentShadows"":{""label"":""半透明面の影"",""help"":""半透明の面にもレイトレースの太陽の影を落とす（SunShadowMap）。""}},""groups"":{""Sky & fog / Sky"":{""name"":""空と霧 / 空"",""help"":""太陽または月と大気から NatureFX の独自エンジンが計算する物理ベースの空。雲、太陽と月の円盤、星を含む。HDRP は反射と環境光用の空としてこれを受け取る。レイトレーシングのスイッチとは独立。""},""Sky & fog / Clouds and stars"":{""name"":""空と霧 / 雲と星"",""help"":""天候の雲の種類に応じたボリュメトリッククラウド。天候の風で流れ、地面に影を落とす。マップは谷に雲海を置ける（[clouds] sea = <height>）。""},""Sky & fog / Fog"":{""name"":""空と霧 / 霧"",""help"":""独自エンジンによる 3D の霧ともや。トレースした太陽または月、空、ランプやヘッドライトで照らされる。マップの局所的な霧とタイヤスモークもこの一部。""},""Sky & fog / HDRP's fog"":{""name"":""空と霧 / HDRP の霧"",""help"":""独自エンジンの霧がオフのときのみ（代わりに HDRP のボリュメトリックフォグ）。""},""Lighting & shadows / Native lighting"":{""name"":""ライティングと影 / 独自エンジンのライティング"",""help"":""不透明物のライティングをすべて独自エンジンで行う：トレースした太陽と月の影、ランプとヘッドライトの影、天空光と GI、反射を、レイトレーシングのスイッチの設定にかかわらず使用。品質は下と「環境光と GI」「反射とガラス」で設定。""},""Lighting & shadows / The game's particles"":{""name"":""ライティングと影 / ゲームのパーティクル"",""help"":""ゲームとコース本来のアルファブレンドのパーティクル（ほこり、水しぶき、煙）を NatureFX のパーティクルシェーダーで描画し、独自エンジンの太陽または月、空、ランプで照らして 3D の霧の中に置く。炎、火花、発光は元のまま。""},""Lighting & shadows / HDRP's sun shadows"":{""name"":""ライティングと影 / HDRP の太陽の影"",""help"":""独自エンジンのライティングがオフのときのみ（トレース影の代わりに HDRP のシャドウマップ）。""},""Sun & time / Time of day"":{""name"":""太陽と時刻 / 時刻"",""help"":""""},""Nature / Wind"":{""name"":""自然 / 風"",""help"":""""},""Weather / Weather"":{""name"":""天候 / 天候"",""help"":""""},""Weather / Season"":{""name"":""天候 / 季節"",""help"":""マップのプロファイルが定める木や草の色と、浮遊パーティクル。自動：秋と雪の天候ではそれに合わせ、それ以外はマップ本来の季節。""},""Weather / Rain and snow"":{""name"":""天候 / 雨と雪"",""help"":""天候に応じてカメラ周辺に降る雨と雪。雨筋は着地点ではね、ヘッドライトや街灯の下で見える。雪は舞い落ちる。0 でオフ。""},""Road / Road surface"":{""name"":""路面 / 路面"",""help"":""跡はカメラの周囲に残り、遠くへ走ると消える。""},""Cars / Headlights"":{""name"":""車 / ヘッドライト"",""help"":""ゲームの丸いスポットの代わりに実際のロービーム：ランプの色と強さ、水平線のすぐ下のくっきりしたカットオフ（路肩側で上がる。左側通行なら左）により、路面は照らし、その上の対向車の目は照らさない。""},""Cars / Car finish"":{""name"":""車 / 車の塗装"",""help"":""実際の車の塗装のように反射：色付きのベースの上に透明なクリア層の鏡面。DX12 レイトレーシング。""},""Cars / Cars in the rain"":{""name"":""車 / 雨の中の車"",""help"":""玉になる水滴、流れ落ちる水、油膜の光沢を車の塗装に重ねて描く。""},""Cars / Smoke, glow and dirt"":{""name"":""車 / スモーク、赤熱、汚れ"",""help"":""太陽、ランプ、ヘッドライトに照らされるボリュメトリックなタイヤスモークと水しぶき（タイヤ痕がオンであること。タイヤが滑った所から出る）。強いブレーキ後に赤熱するブレーキディスク、アフターファイア。""},""Reflections & glass / Ray traced reflections"":{""name"":""反射とガラス / レイトレース反射"",""help"":""濡れた路面、水たまり、車の塗装に、画面外も含めたシーン全体が映る。DX12 のみ。""},""Reflections & glass / Glass"":{""name"":""反射とガラス / ガラス"",""help"":""ガラスをすべて独自エンジンで描画：透過する光（不透明な分だけ色が付く）、映り込み（トレース）、太陽のきらめき、厚いガラスの屈折。その間 HDRP のガラスは非表示。ガラスの反射が必要。""},""Exposure & tone / Own post-processing"":{""name"":""露出とトーン / 独自ポストプロセス"",""help"":""HDRP の代わりに NatureFX 独自の露出（測光と目の順応）、ブルーム、トーンカーブ、色を使用。その間 HDRP のポストプロセス、TAA、カラーグレーディングはオフ（アンチエイリアスは DLSS、なければ独自 TAA）。""},""Exposure & tone / Exposure"":{""name"":""露出とトーン / 露出"",""help"":""固定：手動設定のカメラのように全シーンで同じ露出。目の順応：日陰やトンネルで明るくなり、日なたで戻る。""},""Exposure & tone / Tone"":{""name"":""露出とトーン / トーン"",""help"":""""},""DLSS / NVIDIA DLSS"":{""name"":""DLSS / NVIDIA DLSS"",""help"":""HDRP の TAA の代わりに NatureFX の独自エンジンによるアンチエイリアスとアップスケーリング（RTX GPU。それ以外は独自 TAA）。独自ポストプロセス（露出とトーン）が必要。""},""Lens & eye / Eye and lens"":{""name"":""レンズと目 / 目とレンズ"",""help"":""夜間視：目と同じく、暗い所では色が青緑に寄り、暗部に粒状感が出る。レンズフレア：明るい光源からのゴーストと光条。被写界深度：車にピントを合わせる。リプレイや写真向け。""},""Ambient light & GI / Ray traced ambient light"":{""name"":""環境光と GI / レイトレース環境光"",""help"":""太陽から直接来ない光。周囲が空をさえぎる所（車・屋根・木の下、隅や隙間）で暗くなり、跳ね返った物の色に染まる。太陽光は影の処理に任せる。DX12 のみ。""},""Shader rebuild / Shader rebuild"":{""name"":""シェーダー再構築 / シェーダー再構築"",""help"":""ゲームのシェーダーの代わりに NatureFX 独自のシェーダーを使用。置き換えたマテリアルは実際の色と滑らかさでレイトレーシングにも入る。""},""Ray tracing / Ray tracing engine"":{""name"":""レイトレーシング / レイトレーシングエンジン"",""help"":""NatureFX の独自エンジン（NFXNative.dll）がすべてのレイトレース効果（面、影、環境光、ランプ、光芒、反射）をどうトレースするか。DX12 のみ。""},""Settings / Interface"":{""name"":""設定 / インターフェース"",""help"":""""},""Developer / Debug page"":{""name"":""開発 / デバッグページ"",""help"":""開発用の機能はすべてデバッグページに移動：ビデオメモリ、GPU と CPU の負荷、シーンとログ、開発用スイッチとツール（レイトレーシングの表示、NRD の各部、DLSS テスト、シェーダーの再読み込み、テクスチャ予算、シェーダーダンプ）。この PC のみで提供（127.0.0.1）：下のアドレスをブラウザ（2 台目の画面など）で開く。""},""Map / Map profile"":{""name"":""マップ / マッププロファイル"",""help"":""マップの nfx_profile オブジェクト、または kino/config/NatureFX/maps/<scene>.nfx（こちらが優先）によるマップごとの設定。docs/map-authoring.md""},""Map / Lights and reflections"":{""name"":""マップ / ライトと反射"",""help"":""ライトのマーカーは夕暮れか夜に点灯（確認は「太陽と時刻 > 時刻」で）。""},""Map / Grass and forest"":{""name"":""マップ / 草と森"",""help"":""3D の草には「ゲームのシェーダーを置き換え」のオンが必要（シェーダー再構築）。""},""Map / Ground detail"":{""name"":""マップ / 地面のディテール"",""help"":""地面に埋まった物体が地面の色を受ける部分、プロファイルで描いた汚れ（[paint]）、道路の端の散乱物。独自エンジンが必要。""},""Map / Effects"":{""name"":""マップ / エフェクト"",""help"":""デカール、水たまりと水面、局所的な霧、浮遊パーティクル。それぞれ動作状況や待機している条件を表示。""}},""ui"":{""overview"":""概要"",""performance"":""パフォーマンス"",""memory"":""メモリ"",""scene"":""シーン"",""settings"":""設定"",""developer"":""開発"",""log"":""ログ"",""filter"":""絞り込み"",""changedOnly"":""変更した項目のみ"",""default"":""既定"",""resetToDefault"":""既定値に戻す"",""changed"":""変更あり"",""settingsTitle"":""設定（F8 ウィンドウと同じ。変更はすぐ保存）"",""typeHint"":""スライダーの範囲外の値は右の欄に入力"",""other"":""その他（F8 にない設定）"",""changedCount"":""件を既定値から変更"",""changedTab"":""変更した項目"",""search"":""すべての設定を検索（名前・説明）"",""noMatch"":""該当する設定はありません"",""noneChanged"":""すべて既定値のままです""}}}";
	}
}
